      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/448ac7bcef509c581b6b1208256698c0b90f1ca0",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "da07290d67b25cb91274c10a9a3a9f6ed84dc56a",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/da07290d67b25cb91274c10a9a3a9f6ed84dc56a"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree da07290d67b25cb91274c10a9a3a9f6ed84dc56a\nparent 4ef7904c39fa2c9eedc66d1a75caaf34c0c531b9\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1794174633 +0100\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1794223254 +0100\n\ncrypto: require a fixed-size HKDF output buffer\n\nThe array parameter decays to a pointer, so callers can supply fewer than 32 writable bytes without a compiler diagnostic.\nTake a fixed-size byte span and pass output containers directly so their sizes are checked at compile time.\n",
